## Article 282. Defense procurement case proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article282DefenseProcurement:
  input check content DefenseProcurementCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article282DefenseProcurement:
# Defense procurement decisions can be challenged
  label challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.defenseRelatedDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.defenseRelatedDecision = No
    consequence equals No

# Filing within 30 days
  label timely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Appeal within 10 days
  label timely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinTenDays = No
    consequence equals No
```
